    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d375">

                <pb facs="0730" n="700" xml:id="pg700"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC
                    Atomic/12–447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-04T17:00:00-05:00">December 4, 1947—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>587. For Osborn. Re Osborn letters November 14 to SecState<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d375-f1"/> and December 2 to Rusk.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d375-f2"/>
                    Pending further decisions on atomic energy questions Department approves as next
                    steps to be pursued in AEC (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi>) reconvening the Commission about December
                        15<anchor n="3" xml:id="d375-f3"/> and (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)
                    assigning Committee I further consideration of Soviet proposals June 11, in
                    light of UK questions.</p>
                <p>Decision on resumption of work in Committee 2 deferred pending Osborn visit
                    Washington next Tuesday.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d375-f4"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d375-f1" n="1" xml:id="d375-f1-content">
